---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { columnVariants } from '../../data/columnVariants';
---
<BaseLayout title="Columns Catalogue | Astro Starter" description="Column and grid structures for the Astro and Tailwind starter.">
  <main>
    <header class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-950 text-white"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-8"><a class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-sky-300" href="/">← Block library</a><div class="max-w-3xl"><p class="mt-8 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-blue-300">Astro + Tailwind starter</p><h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">Columns catalogue</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-slate-300 sm:text-lg">Column and grid structures imported from the Pinegrow Tailwind project. Compare equal, asymmetric, sidebar, offset, card and responsive column relationships.</p></div><div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2">{columnVariants.length} variants</span><span class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2">Tailwind source</span><span class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2">Raw structure, no redesign</span></div></div></header>
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-12 lg:px-8" aria-labelledby="catalogue-heading"><div class="mb-10 flex flex-col gap-3 border-b border-slate-300 pb-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between"><div><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-500">Component review</p><h2 id="catalogue-heading" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950">Available column structures</h2></div><p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Columns establish the page rhythm. Compare how each arrangement distributes attention, context and responsive space.</p></div><div class="space-y-10">{columnVariants.map((variant, index) => <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 bg-white shadow-sm" id={variant.id}><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-5 py-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><div><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-blue-700">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')} · {variant.id}</p><h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-950">{variant.title}</h3></div><p class="max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">{variant.description}</p></div><div class="catalogue-preview overflow-hidden bg-white" set:html={variant.html} /></article>)}</div></section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
